{"steam_appid":3393280,"steam_name":"Anime Shop Simulator ✨","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3393280/1835183356/45326eefeb10de6536ea49c5a57d2e9ce581862c/1788886959/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788887579","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257083506/b3c84fa1780fc4ee053e609bb61cafb810d6b693/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788887579","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/6f24080b950136f1f23e2b77f8c4ea75fbc65039/ss_6f24080b950136f1f23e2b77f8c4ea75fbc65039.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789242099","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/85bccf75ef1065bc7f604630ea4fe474e8b20d2c/ss_85bccf75ef1065bc7f604630ea4fe474e8b20d2c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789242099","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/77da8ba4cc2c276624dbec0c42ec69ea3760f357/ss_77da8ba4cc2c276624dbec0c42ec69ea3760f357.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789242099","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/a01d2fbc4065d523d293346662573873b496703b/ss_a01d2fbc4065d523d293346662573873b496703b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789242099","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/34d37f7678f063d2ba63fac590d3a166477dfea4/ss_34d37f7678f063d2ba63fac590d3a166477dfea4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789242099"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/7864d4562f7473aae556ec8112eff25a.poster.avif?t=1789242099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/7864d4562f7473aae556ec8112eff25a.webm?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/7864d4562f7473aae556ec8112eff25a.mp4?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime Shop Simulator</strong> is fun first-person simulation where you become the manager of your very own anime shop!  <br><br>Play solo or join forces with friends in online co-op to expand your shop, attract more customers, and create the ultimate otaku and trading card paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR SHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/7b82936e40fb4dc8be759bdceb32997f.poster.avif?t=1789242099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/7b82936e40fb4dc8be759bdceb32997f.webm?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/7b82936e40fb4dc8be759bdceb32997f.mp4?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream Anime Shop! Arrange manga, figures, and collectible cards on the shelves to create a seamless and enjoyable shopping experience for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/898b69415b4afdfbdd01307b42a10619.poster.avif?t=1789242099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/898b69415b4afdfbdd01307b42a10619.webm?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/898b69415b4afdfbdd01307b42a10619.mp4?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with your friends online in 4-player co-op mode to manage your anime shop together, divide responsibilities, and plan strategies to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/acc5c71ef52da414672ce93d3c4d72c5.poster.avif?t=1789242099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/acc5c71ef52da414672ce93d3c4d72c5.webm?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/acc5c71ef52da414672ce93d3c4d72c5.mp4?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT THEM ALL AND FIGHT IN PVP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbox booster packs and discover unique treasures! Find rare collectible cards to sell for a profit or keep them to complete your ultimate anime card collection. Fight with other players in PvP TCG game and find out who's the best! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/0cb9b6a6078b816d3ea98825539ca13c.poster.avif?t=1789242099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/0cb9b6a6078b816d3ea98825539ca13c.webm?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/0cb9b6a6078b816d3ea98825539ca13c.mp4?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your anime store into a one-of-a-kind otaku haven! Choose your favorite wallpaper, give your shop a unique name, and decorate it with items to reflect your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/b81b79bed39ffeab5e2e9f9100fb1703.poster.avif?t=1789242099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/b81b79bed39ffeab5e2e9f9100fb1703.webm?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/b81b79bed39ffeab5e2e9f9100fb1703.mp4?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enlarge your shop, upgrade its decor, and stay in tune with the dynamic trends of the anime industry to remain competitive.<br><br>In <strong>Anime Shop Simulator</strong> your decisions shape your journey. Can you transform your small boutique into a thriving otaku hub while balancing customer satisfaction and financial success?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/1c3e90ca2eb34ccf8255e672f3edc481.poster.avif?t=1789242099\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/1c3e90ca2eb34ccf8255e672f3edc481.webm?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/1c3e90ca2eb34ccf8255e672f3edc481.mp4?t=1789242099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3.0 GHz or Ryzen 3xxx<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Massively Multiplayer","RPG","Simulation","Sports"],"developers":[" One More Time"],"publishers":[" One More Time"," Polnoch"],"release_date":"Sep 11, 2026"}